    "fornax_jvas_resolution": "Fornax and JVAS both have v ~ 15 km/s but require opposite sigma/m. The resolution is concentration-dependent collapse time: Fornax (c~10) doesn't have time to collapse (t_c > Hubble time), while JVAS (c~50) does (t_c < Hubble time). Both observations are consistent with sigma/m(15) ~ 100 cm^2/g.",
